{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\"issues\":[{\"sec\":\"S02\",\"screen\":\"他努力整理好自己，不让别人看见动摇。\",\"source\":\"这种挺拔的姿态，可以听成一种强烈的自我控制。像一个人整理好衣服、抬起头，不让别人看见动摇。\",\"type\":\"6\",\"severity\":\"轻微\",\"why\":\"定稿将整理衣服、抬头作为对音乐姿态的比喻，屏幕稿却把它改成了人物本人实际做出的动作。\"},{\"sec\":\"S11\",\"screen\":\"害怕还在，脚却已经往前走了。\",\"source\":\"如果把这股推进听成人的处境，最动人的不是忽然变得无所畏惧，而是害怕还在，脚却已经往前走了。\",\"type\":\"6\",\"severity\":\"轻微\",\"why\":\"定稿将脚步向前作为一种听音乐时的人生联想，屏幕稿去掉了这一限定，把比喻直接写成了人物已经向前行动的事实。\"}]}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "5996d18e-3355-492d-83b2-5cef94e290ff", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261108T070028370002Z", "elapsed_seconds": 194.563, "completed_utc": "2026-11-08T07:03:42.947763+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "f12fde96781f3a8ea90502918a0f49730d75478f7cbebf71c93ff9e0e46d4c3c", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_a